<!--meta {"lead": "A menu offers a short list of actions from one trigger, such as an account menu behind Maya's name. Use it when actions are related and rarely needed.", "description": "Menu button with icons, shortcuts, sections, checkable and danger items; APG Menu Button keyboard model.", "pills": ["APG Menu Button", "Status: core set"], "variants": "with icons, with shortcuts, with sections, danger item, checkable items", "states": "closed, open, item hover, item focus, item disabled, item checked", "sources": []} -->
<section class="ds-section" id="overview"><h2><a href="#overview">Overview</a></h2>
  <p>Use a menu when one trigger offers three to seven related actions that do not deserve their own buttons: an account menu (Account settings, Notifications, Sign out) or an appointment's overflow actions (Request a change, Message Nia, Cancel request). It is part of the core set; no mock uses it yet, and the mocks' top bar shows "Maya" as a plain link.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Do not use a menu for navigation between pages that people visit often; use the <a href="top-bar.html">top bar</a> links.</li>
    <li>Do not use a menu to pick a value in a form; use a <a href="select.html">select</a> or <a href="radio-group.html">radio group</a>.</li>
    <li>If there are only two actions, show two buttons.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="anatomy"><h2><a href="#anatomy">Anatomy</a></h2>
  <div class="ds-anatomy">
    <figure class="ds-anatomy__figure">
      <div class="stack stack--sm" style="align-items: flex-start;">
        <button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="menu-anatomy">Maya {{icon:chevron-down|icon--sm}}</button>
        <ul class="menu menu--static" id="menu-anatomy" role="menu" aria-label="Account">
          <li role="none" class="menu__group">Account</li>
          <li role="none"><a class="menu__item" role="menuitem" href="../../mocks/pages/account-settings/default.html">{{icon:user|icon--sm}}Account settings</a></li>
          <li role="none"><a class="menu__item" role="menuitem" href="../../mocks/pages/notification-center/default.html">{{icon:bell|icon--sm}}Notifications</a></li>
          <li role="separator" class="menu__divider"></li>
          <li role="none"><a class="menu__item menu__item--danger" role="menuitem" href="../../mocks/dialogs/sign-out/default.html">{{icon:log-out|icon--sm}}Sign out</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 34%; top: 12%;" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 34%; top: 30%;" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 64%; top: 46%;" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 64%; top: 70%;" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
    </figure>
    <ol class="ds-anatomy__list">
      <li><div><b>Trigger</b><small>A button with <code>aria-haspopup="menu"</code> and <code>aria-expanded</code>; chevron icon.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Section label (optional)</b><small>Overline style; groups items.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Item</b><small>32px tall, 12px padding, optional 16px icon and shortcut.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Panel</b><small>Raised surface, <code>--radius-md</code>, <code>--shadow-3</code>, 4px inner padding, 12rem minimum width.</small></div></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

